#: cnequity/diagnostics/report.py
msgid ""
"\n"
"  These are all hard dependencies; a missing one means the environment is incomplete (usually left over from an uninstall or an interrupted install).\n"
"  Adapters import them lazily inside functions, so they fail only when data is actually fetched, and the daily update silently thins out."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"  这些都是硬依赖，缺失说明环境不完整（多为卸载残留或安装中断）。\n"
"  适配器在函数内惰性 import，所以只在真正取数时才失败，日更会静默变薄。"

