#: cnequity/cli/demo.py
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"Demo lake ready: {data_root}\n"
"Config written to: {config_out}\n"
"\n"
"Next steps:\n"
"  cne query --config {config_out} --sql \"\n"
"    SELECT symbol, trade_date, close, volume, source\n"
"    FROM daily_bars\n"
"    WHERE symbol = '{sample_symbol}'\n"
"    ORDER BY trade_date DESC\n"
"    LIMIT 10\n"
"  \"\n"
"\n"
"Python:\n"
"  from cnequity.query import load\n"
"  bars = load(\"daily_bars\", symbols=[\"{sample_symbol}\"], data_root=\"{data_root}\")\n"
"{value}{value2}\n"
"A whole-market init (hours to days) is a different thing: run `cne init` directly.\n"
"Do not run production against this demo's data_root.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"demo 湖已就绪：{data_root}\n"
"配置写到：     {config_out}\n"
"\n"
"下一步：\n"
"  cne query --config {config_out} --sql \"\n"
"    SELECT symbol, trade_date, close, volume, source\n"
"    FROM daily_bars\n"
"    WHERE symbol = '{sample_symbol}'\n"
"    ORDER BY trade_date DESC\n"
"    LIMIT 10\n"
"  \"\n"
"\n"
"Python：\n"
"  from cnequity.query import load\n"
"  bars = load(\"daily_bars\", symbols=[\"{sample_symbol}\"], data_root=\"{data_root}\")\n"
"{value}{value2}\n"
"全市场初始化（数小时到数天）是另一回事：直接运行 `cne init`。\n"
"不要把这个 demo 的 data_root 拿去跑生产。\n"

