#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"Keys owed by tolerated gaps: {summary}\n"
"These sessions are already past the watermark, and no incremental run will ask for them again; fill them with `cne backfill <dataset> --outstanding`."
msgstr ""
"\n"
