#: cnequity/serve/app.py
#, python-brace-format
msgid "<!doctype html><meta charset=utf-8><style>body{font:15px/1.7 system-ui;margin:3rem auto;max-width:34rem}code{background:#f6f8fa;padding:.1rem .3rem;border-radius:4px}</style><h1>No probe records yet</h1><p>Run a probe first; the report is written into the lake, and this page reads it:</p><pre><code>cne sources probe --vantage cn</code></pre><p>This page only shows existing reports, and opening it does not contact third-party hosts. To probe, start it from the operations page, or run <code>cne sources probe</code>.</p>"
msgstr "<!doctype html><meta charset=utf-8><style>body{font:15px/1.7 system-ui;margin:3rem auto;max-width:34rem}code{background:#f6f8fa;padding:.1rem .3rem;border-radius:4px}</style><h1>还没有探测记录</h1><p>先跑一次探测，报告会写进湖里，这个页面读它：</p><pre><code>cne sources probe --vantage cn</code></pre><p>这个页面只展示已有报告，打开它不会去请求第三方主机。要探测，在操作页启动，或运行 <code>cne sources probe</code>。</p>"

#: cnequity/diagnostics/health_page.py
msgid "<p><b>\"Refused\" is not \"down\".</b> Several sources refuse non-mainland egress at the WAF. For the same host in the same second, the mainland column can be green and the overseas column red, and both are true. So the two vantages sit side by side instead of being merged into one verdict.</p>"
msgstr "<p><b>「被拒」不等于「挂了」。</b>好几个源在 WAF 层拒绝非大陆出口。同一个主机、同一秒，大陆列可以是绿的而海外列是红的，两个都是真的。所以两个视角并排放，不合并成一个结论。</p>"

#: cnequity/diagnostics/health_page.py
msgid "<p><b>HTTP 200 is not \"available\".</b> EastMoney answers with a risk-control page under 200, Sina with an empty array under 200, and THS with 200 and an empty body when rate-limiting. So every probe asserts on the <b>response body</b>, not the status line; \"empty\" is its own state because it looks healthier than a failure and is actually more dangerous — a backfill silently truncates.</p>"
msgstr "<p><b>HTTP 200 不等于可用。</b>东财会用 200 返回风控页，新浪会用 200 返回空数组，同花顺限流时也是 200 加空响应。所以每个探测都断言<b>响应体</b>而不是状态行；「空响应」这一档单独拎出来，因为它看起来比失败健康，实际更危险——回填会静默截断。</p>"

#: cnequity/diagnostics/health_page.py
msgid "<p><b>One probe is not an SLA.</b> Each source gets one request per probe. Green means that one request succeeded, not that the next thousand will — for the few rate-limited sources here, that is a different question entirely.</p>"
msgstr "<p><b>一次探测不是 SLA。</b>每个源每次只发一个请求。绿色说明那一个请求成功了，不代表接下来一千个也会成功——对这里几个有频率风控的源来说，那是完全不同的问题。</p>"

#: cnequity/diagnostics/health_page.py
msgid "<p><b>Probes run the adapters' own code.</b> URL constants, EastMoney's auth headers, THS's pacing, the TDX binary protocol — all the same ones the daily pipeline uses; when an adapter changes, its probe changes with it.</p>"
msgstr "<p><b>探测走的是适配器自己的代码。</b>URL 常量、东财的鉴权头、同花顺的限速、TDX 的二进制协议，用的都是日更流水线在用的那套；适配器改了，探测跟着改。</p>"

