#: cnequity/cli/schedule_cmds.py
msgid ""
"Check the day's update, back up what cannot be rebuilt, and preview expiry.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"The scheduled timer runs this once after each session's daily update. In order:\n"
"the session's daily group runs ([job.maintenance].gate_groups fail at once, others after\n"
"soft_fail_max_days sessions in a row), a retry of keys in the debt ledger\n"
"(`cne backfill <dataset> --outstanding`), the run audit (the whole lake on\n"
"[job.maintenance].full_audit_weekday), the freshness gate,\n"
"source probes and SLO, run evidence over 20 sessions, a metadata backup\n"
"(manifest DB, receipts, quality findings; never curated Parquet), and `cne run clean`'s preview.\n"
"Exits 1 when a group run, the audit, the freshness gate or the backup fails; source,\n"
"debt-retry and run-evidence findings are reported without failing."
msgstr ""
"检查当天的日更，备份无法重建的数据，并预览过期文件。\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"定时任务在每个交易日日更后运行一次。依次是：\n"
"当个交易日各日更组的运行结果（[job.maintenance].gate_groups 失败立即判失败，其他组\n"
"连续失败 soft_fail_max_days 个交易日才判失败）、重试欠账里的键（`cne backfill <数据集> --outstanding`）、\n"
"运行审计（[job.maintenance].full_audit_weekday 那天改为全湖审计）、新鲜度门禁、源探针与 SLO、\n"
"最近 20 个交易日的运行证据、元数据备份\n"
"（manifest 数据库、收据、质量结论；不含 curated Parquet），以及 `cne run clean` 的预览。\n"
"日更组、审计、新鲜度门禁或备份失败时退出 1；源探针、欠账重试和运行证据的发现只报告，不判失败。"

#: cnequity/cli/setup_cmds.py
msgid ""
"Check the environment, optional dependencies and config for things that would quietly break.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Needs no config (it runs right after installing) and no network. It exits non-zero only when data would really be lost;\n"
"the typical case is a source enabled in the config whose package is not installed, which no other command mentions."
msgstr ""
"体检环境、可选依赖和配置，找出会悄悄坏掉的地方。\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"不需要配置（刚装完就能跑），也不需要网络。只有确实会丢数据时才非零退出 ——\n"
"最典型的是配置里启用了某个源、但它背后的包没装，这件事别的命令都不会说。"

#: cnequity/cli/_root.py
msgid "Check the lake"
msgstr "检查数据湖"

#: cnequity/serve/ops/scheduler.py
msgid "Checked once a minute. The daily update and catch-up each try once per trading day; the catch-up only handles snapshots and waits for the daily update to have run. Backups try once per calendar day once their time comes, and event streams run at their own frequency, weekends and holidays included. When a task is busy it waits and the next check decides again. It keeps working after the web page or serve is closed. Windows and macOS need the current user logged in; Linux needs the cron service running. Nothing runs during sleep, and it decides again after waking; the daily update and catch-up go no later than 09:15 on the next trading day, backups only make up the same day, and event streams do not accumulate missed runs. Only tasks created from the web are managed here; check existing scripts and other system tasks first to avoid double scheduling."
msgstr "每分钟检查一次。日更与补抓每个交易日各尝试一次；补抓只处理快照，并等待日更已执行。备份每个自然日到点后尝试一次，事件流按独立频率运行，含周末和节假日。任务占用时等待，下次检查再判断。关闭网页或 serve 后继续生效。Windows 和 macOS 需要当前用户已登录；Linux 需要 cron 服务运行。休眠期间不执行，恢复后再判断；日更与补抓最迟到下个交易日 09:15，备份只补当天，事件流不累积补跑。这里只管理 Web 创建的任务，已有的脚本和其他系统任务请先核对，避免重复调度。"

