#: cnequity/cli/backfill_cmds.py
msgid "Comma-separated symbols to restrict the scope: for scoped backfills of intraday, trading_status and corporate_actions, and scoped repairs of financial_statement_items, daily_bars and share_structure. trading_status records the exact scope in its checkpoint and coverage evidence; daily_bars writes this explicit scope into the backfill metadata."
msgstr "限定范围的标的列表，逗号分隔：用于 intraday、trading_status、corporate_actions 的限定回填，以及 financial_statement_items、daily_bars、share_structure 的限定修复。trading_status 的 checkpoint 与覆盖证据会记下确切范围；daily_bars 会把这个显式范围写进 backfill 元数据。"

