#: cnequity/serve/ops/catalog.py
msgid "Comma-separated, e.g. 600519.SH,000001.SZ. Leave empty for the dataset's default range."
msgstr "逗号分隔，如 600519.SH,000001.SZ。不填就是该数据集的默认范围。"

#: cnequity/cli/maintain_cmds.py
msgid ""
"Compact runs in staging that have finished but are not yet published into curated.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Without --run-id it handles every such run in turn: the process has ended, it has staged\n"
"files, and it has no successful compact yet. Runs still going, and init runs (which\n"
"`cne init` resumes itself), are left alone; each dataset is still guarded by the compact\n"
"gate, and datasets with unfinished batches are left for `cne run retry`."
msgstr ""
"把 staging 里已经结束、但还没发布的 run compact 进 curated。\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"不带 --run-id 时逐个处理所有这样的 run：进程已结束、有暂存文件、还没有成功的 compact。\n"
"正在跑的 run 和 init run（由 `cne init` 自己续跑）不动；每个数据集仍受 compact\n"
"门禁保护，有未完成批次的数据集留给 `cne run retry`。"

#: cnequity/cli/govern_cmds.py
msgid "Compare OLD_CONTRACT with NEW_CONTRACT (the current registry by default)."
msgstr "比较 OLD_CONTRACT 与 NEW_CONTRACT（默认用当前注册表）。"

#: cnequity/cli/quality_cmds.py
msgid ""
"Compare what this lake should have with what it actually has.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"`cne audit` asks whether the data that landed is right. This asks whether what should have landed did:\n"
"a different failure, and the kind a step that throws on contact causes. Without it, a dataset can fail every run for weeks\n"
"while each run only records a failed batch.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Gaps are split by whether they can be filled: a `by_date` dataset missing a session is a fault, while a snapshot dataset missing one\n"
"is simply its shape, and no backfill could fill it honestly. `--repair` only runs the first kind.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"`--bars` and `--runs` ask the same question at two other grains: \"security × session\" instead of \"dataset × session\",\n"
"and \"one run per session\" instead of rows in the lake.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"`--industry` asks it of a classification: each snapshot against the stocks listed that day, and each industry against\n"
"the previous snapshot, so a classification that silently loses a slice of the market or a whole industry shows."
msgstr ""
"拿这个湖应该有的东西，对一对它实际有的东西。\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"`cne audit` 问的是落进来的数据对不对。这条问的是该落的有没有落 ——\n"
"这是另一种失败，也是一碰就抛的 step 会造成的那种。没有它，一个数据集可以连着几周每次 run 都失败，\n"
"而每一次 run 都只是记一条 failed batch。\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"缺口按「能不能补」分开：`by_date` 数据集少一个交易日是故障，snapshot 数据集少一个是它本来的形态，\n"
"任何回填都补不诚实。`--repair` 只会去跑前一种。\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"`--bars` 和 `--runs` 在另外两个粒度上问同一个问题：一个是「证券 × 交易日」而不是「数据集 × 交易日」，\n"
"另一个是「每个交易日一次 run」而不是湖里的行。\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"`--industry` 对行业分类问同一个问题：每个快照对照当天上市的股票，每个行业对照上一个快照，\n"
"分类悄悄少了一块市场或整个行业时就能看出来。"

