#: cnequity/cli/maintain_cmds.py
msgid "Preview `logs/cne-*.log` older than this many days, without deleting; 0 skips."
msgstr "预览超过这么多天的 `logs/cne-*.log`，不删除；0 表示跳过。"

#: cnequity/serve/ops/catalog.py
