msgstr "预览配置升级"

#: cnequity/cli/maintain_cmds.py
msgid ""
"Preview expired data without physically deleting it; deletion must be confirmed on the serve operations page.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\"Cleanable\" means: the run is in a terminal state (success/warning/degraded/failed), every batch has settled,\n"
"and a successful compact has been recorded. Staging that did not finish or was never compacted stays for a retry;\n"
"--force only widens the preview. Source snapshots and logs are preview-only too, with bytes_freed 0 throughout.\n"
"Old versions and staging that merged successfully with no unfinished batches can be deleted after confirming on the serve storage page.\n"
"Orphaned staging, source snapshots and logs are only reported for now."
msgstr ""
"预览过期数据，不执行物理删除；删除须在 serve 运维网页确认。\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"「可清理」是指：run 处于终态（success/warning/degraded/failed）、所有批次都已落定，\n"
"并且记录过一次成功的 compact。没跑完或从没 compact 过的 staging 会留着等重试，\n"
"--force 只扩大预览范围。来源快照和日志也仅预览，全部 bytes_freed 为 0。\n"
"历史版本和已成功合并且无未完成批次的 staging 可在 serve 存储运维页确认删除。\n"
"orphan 暂存、来源快照和日志暂仅报告。"

#: cnequity/cli/maintain_cmds.py
msgid "Preview meta/source_snapshots run_id directories older than this many days (the latest one per dataset / source is always kept)."
msgstr "预览超过这么多天的 meta/source_snapshots run_id 目录（每个数据集 / 源的最新一份始终保留）。"

#: cnequity/cli/repair_cmds.py
msgid "Preview only. Run `cne migrate --apply` to apply and record them."
msgstr "仅预览。运行 `cne migrate --apply` 执行并记录。"

#: cnequity/cli/backfill_cmds.py
msgid "Preview only; add --apply to run it."
msgstr "仅预览；加 --apply 才运行。"

#: cnequity/cli/maintain_cmds.py
msgid "Preview orphan staging older than this many days that is not recorded in the manifest."
msgstr "预览超过这么多天、且 manifest 里没有记录的孤儿 staging。"

#: cnequity/cli/repair_cmds.py
msgid ""
"Preview, or with --apply run, the one-off fixes this lake still owes.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"A release that fixes a writer can leave rows the old writer stored. Each such fix is a\n"
"migration; meta/state/lake.json records the version that built the lake (it owes nothing\n"
"introduced earlier) and every migration it has applied or found nothing to do.\n"
"A preview reports how many rows each would change. --apply runs them in order: each takes the\n"
"lake lock, publishes through the repair gate and keeps the previous revision readable."
msgstr ""
"预览，或加 --apply 运行这个湖还欠的一次性修正。\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"新版本修好写入逻辑后，旧版本存下的行仍需修正。每个修正是一个\n"
"迁移；meta/state/lake.json 记录建湖的版本（早于它引入的迁移不需要运行）\n"
"以及已经运行过、或检查后无需运行的迁移。\n"
"预览报告每个迁移会改动多少行。--apply 按顺序运行：每个迁移持有\n"
"湖的变更锁，经修复门禁发布，旧版本保留可读。"

