msgid "Print only sources, scope and fetch method, plus a request budget for derivatives. Fetches no data and does not write the lake."
msgstr "只输出来源、范围和抓取方式；衍生品另给请求预算。不取数、不写湖。"

#: cnequity/cli/setup_cmds.py
