#: cnequity/serve/ops/catalog.py
msgid "Re-fetch only datasets still behind the last trading day. Optionally limit to schedule groups or to snapshots."
msgstr "只重抓仍然落后于最后交易日的数据集。可限定调度组，或只重抓快照。"

#: cnequity/cli/govern_cmds.py
msgid ""
"Re-hash every file in a snapshot and reconcile it with the manifest.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Exits 1 as soon as a size or digest mismatches, so it can serve directly as a gate in a scheduled job.\n"
"Run it before trusting a snapshot you did not just create:\n"
"bit rot and a truncated copy look identical until the hashes disagree."
msgstr ""
"把快照里每个文件重新哈希，与 manifest 对账。\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"一旦发现大小或摘要不符就退出 1，所以它可以直接当定时任务里的门禁。\n"
"在信任一份不是你刚刚创建的快照之前先跑它 ——\n"
"位腐烂和被截断的拷贝，在哈希对不上之前长得一模一样。"

#: cnequity/serve/ops/catalog.py
msgid "Re-run a specific day instead of the incremental window."
msgstr "补跑某一天，不走增量窗口。"

#: cnequity/cli/ths_official_cmds.py
msgid ""
"Re-source the deep history from the licensed API instead of the scraper.\n"
"\n"
"`daily_bars` splits by source: an unauthenticated scrape of 10jqka's public\n"
"pages owns 2001-2015 alone, while 2016 onward has a configured backup. This\n"
"moves the part the official API reaches: measured at 4,398,523 rows, 98.68%\n"
"of that window once applied.\n"
"\n"
"**Switching, not routing**, so `--apply` is required and a bare run only\n"
"reports. Pass `--adjudicator` as well and a *disputed* row is only switched\n"
"when an independent source backs the peer: measured against baostock over\n"
"1,418 disputes, the peer was right 1,167 times and the incumbent 251, with\n"
"no three-way split, so switching blindly imports 251 known regressions.\n"
"\n"
"Build the adjudicator from a vendor sharing no lineage with either side.\n"
"Both candidates here are THS (同花顺) sources, so they cannot arbitrate each other."
msgstr ""
"Re-source the deep history from the licensed API instead of the scraper.\n"
"\n"
"`daily_bars` splits by source: an unauthenticated scrape of 10jqka's public\n"
"pages owns 2001-2015 alone, while 2016 onward has a configured backup. This\n"
"moves the part the official API reaches — measured at 4,398,523 rows, 98.68%\n"
"of that window once applied.\n"
"\n"
"**Switching, not routing**, so `--apply` is required and a bare run only\n"
"reports. Pass `--adjudicator` as well and a *disputed* row is only switched\n"
"when an independent source backs the peer: measured against baostock over\n"
"1,418 disputes, the peer was right 1,167 times and the incumbent 251, with\n"
"no three-way split — so switching blindly imports 251 known regressions.\n"
"\n"
"Build the adjudicator from a vendor sharing no lineage with either side.\n"
"Both candidates here are 同花顺's, so they cannot arbitrate each other."

#: cnequity/diagnostics/source_health.py
msgid "Reached but refused (403 / risk-control page / CAPTCHA). Common from outside mainland China."
msgstr "到达了但被拒绝（403 / 风控页 / 人机验证）。常见于非大陆出口。"

#: cnequity/cli/delisted_cmds.py
msgid ""
"Read the delisted directory; history is backfilled with backfill daily_bars.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Rebuilding the directory itself (code-space scans, terminal-state reconciliation,\n"
"instruments repairs and the coverage gate) is a one-off engineering job, not routine\n"
"operations, and lives in `scripts/delisted_ops.py`."
msgstr ""
"读取退市名录；历史行情通过 backfill daily_bars 补数。\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"重建名录本身 —— 代码空间扫描、终态对账、instruments 修复和覆盖门禁 ——\n"
"是一次性的工程而不是日常运维，放在 `scripts/delisted_ops.py` 里。"

#: cnequity/cli/consume_cmds.py
msgid "Read-only DuckDB SQL; each dataset is a view named as in `cne status --datasets`."
msgstr "只读 DuckDB SQL；每个数据集是一个视图，名称同 `cne status --datasets`。"

#: cnequity/cli/quality_cmds.py
msgid "Read-only acceptance check of a derivatives research window; requires --dataset, --start, --end."
msgstr "只读验收衍生品研究窗口；需 --dataset、--start、--end。"

#: cnequity/serve/ops/catalog.py
msgid "Read-only check of lake coverage. Exit code 1 means findings, not a command error."
msgstr "只读校验湖的覆盖。退出码 1 表示有发现，不是命令出错。"

#: cnequity/cli/quality_cmds.py
msgid "Read-only completeness of industry_members by classification system, level and snapshot date; --start/--end narrow it."
msgstr "只读检查 industry_members 按分类体系、层级、快照日的完整性；可用 --start/--end 缩小范围。"

#: cnequity/serve/ops/catalog.py
msgid "Rebuild derived data"
msgstr "重算派生数据"

#: cnequity/serve/ops/catalog.py
msgid "Rebuild metrics table"
msgstr "重建度量表"

#: cnequity/serve/ops/catalog.py
msgid "Recompute backup file digests and check for missing or corrupt files and manifest mismatches."
msgstr "重新计算备份文件摘要，检查缺失、损坏与清单一致性。"

#: cnequity/serve/ops/catalog.py
msgid "Recompute from published data. Full mode rewrites partitions. 15 / 30 / 60-minute bars are skipped by default; select them to write them to the lake here."
msgstr "从已发布的数据重算。全量会重写分区。15 / 30 / 60 分钟线默认不计算，选中后在这里入湖。"

#: cnequity/cli/maintain_cmds.py
msgid "Recompute only these datasets (repeatable). Rows for other datasets stay unchanged."
msgstr "只重算这些数据集（可重复）。其它数据集的行保持不变。"

#: cnequity/cli/maintain_cmds.py
msgid ""
"Recompute partition_stats / provenance_stats from curated and derived.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Recomputes unconditionally by default. For a timer use `--if-stale`: it returns at once when nothing changed,\n"
"and steps aside rather than queueing when a concurrent recompute holds the lock;\n"
"a dashboard request stuck behind a full scan is worse than numbers one run behind.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Staleness is judged by run id, not by the clock. Only ingestion changes this lake,\n"
"so stats built after the last run are current, however old they look."
msgstr ""
"从 curated 和 derived 重算 partition_stats / provenance_stats。\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"默认无条件重算。要挂定时器请用 `--if-stale`：没有任何变化时它直接返回，\n"
"并且在已有并发重算持锁时选择让路而不是排队 ——\n"
"一个卡在全量扫描后面的面板请求，比落后一次 run 的数字更糟。\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"是否过期按 run id 判断，不看时钟。只有采集会改变这个湖，\n"
"所以在最后一次 run 之后建的统计就是新的，无论看上去多旧。"

#: cnequity/serve/ops/catalog.py
msgid "Recompute row counts, sizes and source distribution. No fetching."
msgstr "重算行数、体积和来源分布。不取数。"

#: cnequity/cli/maintain_cmds.py
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Recomputed ({value}): {value2} datasets, {rows:,} rows in {elapsed_seconds:.1f}s"
msgstr "已重算（{value}）：{value2} 个数据集、{rows:,} 行，耗时 {elapsed_seconds:.1f}s"

#: cnequity/cli/repair_cmds.py
msgid "Recover consolidated statement items from original periodic reports; does not use comparative-period figures, and does not pass off today's collection as a historical observation."
msgstr "从原始定期报告恢复合并报表科目；不使用比较期数，不把今天采集伪装成历史观测。"

#: cnequity/cli/repair_cmds.py
msgid "Recover the official dated constituents and real weights that are obtainable; does not project backwards or fill weights across dates."
msgstr "恢复可取得的官方带日期成分与真实权重；不向过去倒推，也不跨日期填权重。"

#: cnequity/domain/datasets.py
msgid "Reference"
msgstr "基础参考"

#: cnequity/cli/run_cmds.py
msgid "Refetch only datasets still behind the last trading day. Run it a few hours after the main pipeline: once a snapshot dataset loses the day's window to a source outage, it cannot be recovered the next day."
msgstr "只重抓仍然落后于最后交易日的数据集。挂在主 pipeline 几小时之后跑：snapshot 类数据集一旦因源端中断丢掉当天窗口，第二天就补不回来了。"

#: cnequity/cli/consume_cmds.py
msgid "Refresh the on-demand cache before fetching (requires both --dataset and --symbol)."
msgstr "抓取前先刷新按需缓存（需要同时给 --dataset 和 --symbol）。"

#: cnequity/cli/storage_cmds.py
