msgstr "登记外置原文存储；本地保留来源记录，不移动或删除文件。"

#: cnequity/serve/ops/records.py
msgid "Rejected"
msgstr "已拒绝"

#: cnequity/serve/guard.py
msgid "Remote access cannot start operations from the dashboard by default. Start serve with --allow-remote-ops to enable it."
msgstr "远程访问默认不能从面板发起操作。启动时加上 --allow-remote-ops 才能开启。"

#: cnequity/cli/schedule_cmds.py
msgid "Remove the scheduled update for this lake?"
msgstr "移除这个湖的定时更新吗？"

#: cnequity/cli/schedule_cmds.py
msgid "Remove without asking for confirmation."
msgstr "不询问确认直接移除。"

#: cnequity/cli/schedule_cmds.py
msgid "Removed. Nothing runs on a schedule for this lake now."
msgstr "已移除。这个湖现在没有任何定时任务。"

#: cnequity/cli/repair_cmds.py
msgid "Repair Shanghai/Shenzhen exchange-traded funds with zero volume but positive turnover; must agree with official daily prices and amounts."
msgstr "修复零成交量、正成交额的沪深场内基金；须与官方日线价格及金额一致。"

#: cnequity/cli/backfill_cmds.py
msgid ""
"Repair corporate_actions payment dates: reviewed issuer announcements first, then Baostock.\n"
"\n"
"A payment date earlier than the ex-date is treated as unknown. With --issuer-notices-only,\n"
"reviewed bonus/transfer share terms are repaired too and Baostock is not queried."
msgstr ""
"修复 corporate_actions 的现金到账日：先用已审发行人公告，再用 Baostock。\n"
"\n"
"早于除权日的到账日视为未知。加 --issuer-notices-only 时，\n"
"同时修复已审送转条款，且不请求 Baostock。"

#: cnequity/cli/backfill_cmds.py
msgid "Repair only the keys owed by tolerated gaps; scope and window come from the debt ledger, ignoring --symbols/--start/--end. Filled keys are cleared from the ledger; keys still missing stay owed."
msgstr "只修复被容忍缺口欠下的那些 key，范围和窗口都取自欠账台账，不看 --symbols/--start/--end。补上的 key 会销账，仍然缺的继续欠着。"

#: cnequity/cli/repair_cmds.py
msgid "Repair stock factors and ETF/LOF share conversions together; previews offline and saves a plan by default."
msgstr "统一修复股票因子与 ETF/LOF 份额折算；默认离线预览并保存计划。"

#: cnequity/cli/repair_cmds.py
msgid "Repair stored data: previews by default; --apply verifies, publishes, and keeps the old version."
msgstr "修复已存数据：默认只预览，--apply 核验后发布并保留旧版本。"

#: cnequity/cli/repair_cmds.py
msgid "Reparse existing original reports; unchanged facts retain their original observation times."
msgstr "重新解析已有原文报告；内容未变的行保留原始观测时间。"

#: cnequity/storage/migrations.py
msgid "Replace COMEX gold bars stored before their session closed"
msgstr "替换在交易时段结束前存入的 COMEX 黄金日线"

#: cnequity/cli/backfill_cmds.py
msgid ""
"Replace Shanghai/Shenzhen daily_bars rows whose turnover is missing, zero or misaligned.\n"
"\n"
"The whole same-day Baostock row replaces it when OHLC agree within half a cent; otherwise,\n"
"or when Baostock has no row, the original values stay."
msgstr ""
"替换成交额缺失、为 0 或量额错位的沪深 daily_bars 行。\n"
"\n"
"开高低收在半分钱内一致时，用 Baostock 同日行整行替换；否则，\n"
"或 Baostock 没有该行时，保留原值。"

#: cnequity/cli/govern_cmds.py
msgid "Replace an existing snapshot with the same name only after the archive passes verification."
msgstr "仅在归档校验通过之后，才替换已存在的同名快照。"

#: cnequity/cli/repair_cmds.py
msgid "Replace complete index snapshots using their actual file dates; retain old revisions."
msgstr "按文件实际日期替换完整指数快照，保留旧版本。"

#: cnequity/storage/migrations.py
msgid "Replace push2 valuation snapshots stored under the wrong date"
msgstr "替换存错日期的 push2 估值快照"

#: cnequity/cli/repair_cmds.py
