msgid "Run all schedule groups only, without the event streams. Kept for old schedules that run `cne run events` separately; `cne run daily` without arguments already includes all schedule groups and event streams."
msgstr "只跑全部调度组，不含事件流。给已经单独调度 `cne run events` 的旧定时任务保留；不带参数的 `cne run daily` 已经包含全部调度组和事件流。"

