msgstr "把能补的缺口跑一遍回填，按数据集从新到旧。"

#: cnequity/serve/ops/catalog.py
msgid "Run event streams"
msgstr "跑事件流"

#: cnequity/serve/ops/catalog.py
msgid "Run every daily-update schedule group in config order, then the event streams. Continues if a group fails."
msgstr "按配置顺序跑全部日更调度组，再跑事件流。某组失败也继续。"

#: cnequity/cli/schedule_cmds.py
msgid "Run evidence, last 20 sessions"
msgstr "运行证据（最近 20 个交易日）"

#: cnequity/cli/quality_cmds.py
msgid "Run id to show, or 'latest' (default). Includes stage results per dataset."
msgstr "要看的 run id，或 'latest'（默认）。包含各数据集 stage 的结果。"

#: cnequity/cli/backfill_cmds.py
msgid "Run it; without this only the plan is printed."
msgstr "运行；不加只打印计划。"

#: cnequity/serve/ops/catalog.py
msgid "Run maintenance"
msgstr "运行维护"

#: cnequity/cli/run_cmds.py
msgid ""
"Run one day's update: every daily schedule group, then the event streams.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"With no arguments it runs every enabled schedule group in config order (continuing if a group fails), audits the whole lake once,\n"
"then runs the event streams (announcements, regulatory events, news; weekends and holidays included). Schedule groups skip\n"
"non-trading days automatically while event streams still run.\n"
"`--group` runs one group, `--core-only` only the core backbone, `--no-events` skips the event streams."
msgstr ""
"跑一天的更新：全部日更调度组，再跑事件流。\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"不带参数时按配置顺序跑完全部已启用的调度组（某组失败也继续），对整个湖审计一次，然后跑事件流\n"
"（公告、监管事件、资讯；周末和节假日照常）。非交易日调度组自动跳过，事件流仍会运行。\n"
"`--group` 只跑一个组，`--core-only` 只跑核心骨架，`--no-events` 不跑事件流。"

#: cnequity/cli/run_cmds.py
msgid "Run only the [[job.daily.waves]] core skeleton (the old no-argument behavior)."
msgstr "只跑 [[job.daily.waves]] 核心骨架（旧版不带参数时的行为）。"

#: cnequity/cli/run_cmds.py
msgid "Run only the daily schedule groups for these research packs, without the event streams. If omitted, all schedule groups and event streams still run. Repeatable."
msgstr "只跑这些研究包对应的日更调度组，不跑事件流。不写则仍跑全部调度组和事件流。可重复。"

#: cnequity/serve/ops/catalog.py
msgid "Run only the selected daily-update schedule group. Does not mark today as done, so the scheduled full run still happens."
msgstr "只跑选定的日更调度组。不写“今天已跑过”的标记，定时全流程仍会执行。"

#: cnequity/cli/schedule_cmds.py
msgid "Run the config's [[job.events.schedules]] (or turn them off). Default: keep the current setting; on when the config defines schedules and nothing is set yet."
msgstr "运行配置里的 [[job.events.schedules]]（或关闭）。默认保留现有设置；配置定义了计划且尚无设置时开启。"

#: cnequity/cli/run_cmds.py
msgid ""
"Run the continuous event streams by calendar day (announcements, news).\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"These sources publish on weekends and holidays too, so this job is not gated on trading days and takes its own ingest lock:\n"
"it neither waits for the evening batch nor gets skipped because the market is closed. Each group publishes its staging data\n"
"through its own `compact`. A bare `cne run daily` already ends with this step; run it alone to refresh a group more often."
msgstr ""
"按自然日跑持续事件流（公告、新闻）。\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"这些源在周末和节假日照常发布，所以这个 job 不受交易日门禁约束，并且拿自己的采集锁：\n"
"它既不等晚间批次，也不会因为休市而被跳过。每个组通过自带的 `compact` 发布它 staging 的数据。\n"
"不带参数的 `cne run daily` 末尾已经包含这一步；单独运行用于更高频地刷新某个组。"

#: cnequity/cli/repair_cmds.py
msgid "Run the owed migrations and record each result in meta/state/lake.json."
msgstr "运行欠下的迁移，并把每个结果记入 meta/state/lake.json。"

#: cnequity/cli/_root.py
msgid "Run the pipeline"
msgstr "跑 pipeline"

#: cnequity/cli/_root.py
msgid ""
"Run the pipeline, and repair runs that did not finish.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Schedulers run `daily` and `events`. The other three get things back on track by hand after a failure:\n"
"`retry` re-runs, `compact` publishes the data a crashed run left in staging,\n"
"and `clean` clears staging that has already been compacted. Every schedule group\n"
"has its own `compact` step, so a normal day needs none of the three."
msgstr ""
"跑 pipeline，以及修复没跑完的 run。\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"调度器要跑的是 `daily` 和 `events`。另外三条是失败之后手动回到正轨的路：\n"
"`retry` 重跑，`compact` 把崩溃的 run 留在 staging 的数据发布出去，\n"
"`clean` 清掉已经 compact 过的 staging。每个调度组自带 `compact` 步骤，\n"
"所以正常的一天不会用到这三条。"

#: cnequity/cli/quality_cmds.py
msgid ""
"Run the quality audit; add --full for a health snapshot of the whole lake as it is now.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"A bare `cne run daily` already audits once after all schedule groups (with `--core-only`, as the last step of the `finalize` wave),\n"
"so running it here re-audits data that has already been audited; the repository's health_notify.sh does not go through `run daily` and audits once itself.\n"
"What is not scheduled is `--full`: it judges the state of the lake right now rather than what one run wrote,\n"
"and it is what the health check and the dashboard read."
msgstr ""
"跑质量审计；加 --full 则给出当前整个湖的健康快照。\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"不带参数的 `cne run daily` 在全部调度组之后已经审计一次（`--core-only` 则是 `finalize` wave 的最后一步），\n"
"所以在这里跑等于把已经审过的数据再审一遍；仓库的 health_notify.sh 不经 `run daily`，由它自己审计一次。\n"
"没有被调度的是 `--full`：它判的是此刻这个湖的状态，而不是某一次 run 写了什么，\n"
"健康检查和面板读的也是它。"

#: cnequity/cli/run_cmds.py
msgid "Run with backfill semantics: skip the trading-day gate and each step's own incremental window, and fetch the window given by the backfill scope in the config instead. Used to rerun a day the schedule missed; scheduled runs never pass it."
msgstr "用 backfill 语义跑：跳过交易日门禁和每个 step 自己的增量窗口，改为抓配置里 backfill scope 指定的窗口。用于补跑调度漏掉的某一天；日常调度从不带这个参数。"

#: cnequity/cli/run_cmds.py
