#: cnequity/cli/backfill_cmds.py
#, python-brace-format
msgid "{dataset}: --start {start} is before the source's history floor. For every symbol, upstream provides nothing earlier than {earliest}, and no backfill source extends it. Use --start {earliest} or later."
msgstr "{dataset}：--start {start} 早于源的历史下限。对任何标的，上游都不提供早于 {earliest} 的数据，也没有任何回填源能延长它。请改用 --start {earliest} 或更晚的日期。"

#: cnequity/cli/backfill_cmds.py
#, python-brace-format
msgid "{dataset}: --start {start} is beyond the history depth the source can provide. For symbols quoted every session, upstream keeps only about {history_horizon_days} sessions per symbol (back to roughly {earliest}), and no backfill source extends it. Use --start {earliest} or later. (Thinly traded symbols have bars on fewer days, so they reach further back. To get those, narrow [{block}].scope to a watchlist first: sweeping the whole market from that start burns hours on symbols with no data at all.)"
msgstr "{dataset}：--start {start} 早于源能提供的历史深度。对每个交易日都有报价的标的，上游每个标的大约只保留 {history_horizon_days} 个交易日（大致回到 {earliest}），并且没有任何回填源能延长它。请改用 --start {earliest} 或更晚的日期。（成交稀疏的标的有 K 线的天数更少，因此能回溯得更远。要取那些，请先把 [{block}].scope 收窄成一个观察列表 —— 用那个起点扫全市场，会在根本没有数据的标的上耗掉好几个小时。）"

#: cnequity/cli/maintain_cmds.py
